\f1\fs22 PAPER\'92s computer humpers could find anyone. If you were Airborne, it was your show-off lifestyle that gave you away; if you were Cloudborne, it was all down to flashing their armpits at security scanners and funds transfer machines. Not that Emil Kalheri had personally blipped his armpit when he washed up at Sunny Contemplations Funeral Home.\
